| Icons               | lucide-react                                    |
| Animations          | tw-animate-css                                  |

Backend SDK (wired): @supabase/supabase-js + @supabase/ssr
Also installed: Zustand, React Hook Form, Zod, @dnd-kit/*, date-fns, Sonner, recharts 3
(charts via components/ui/chart.tsx), DOMPurify, jsPDF, xlsx.
- TanStack Query is installed but NOT wired — the synced-store bridge covers caching.
- NOT using: Axios (Supabase replaces it). FullCalendar and Vitest are not installed.


